{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmhGooAybLrJWaPyJsn8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**What I'd tell my friend:** I'd go with פסגות. It's top of the list, it has a little \"★ הזול\" next to it, and the account cost is 1,058 ₪, way less than everyone else. But I didn't actually finish. The site says \"האתר לא אסף קרנות על test\", so it has no fund for my index. To find which fund is cheapest I'd have to add one myself (\"+ הוספת קרן שלא ברשימה\"), and I don't know any fund names. So I'm only half sure: fairly sure about which account, no idea which fund.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Top of the page:** the heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן\" was exactly what I wanted. \"test\" was already selected. I left the sliders as they were: 10,000 ₪ today, 500 a month, 10 years, 7%. I didn't move them to my 30,000.\n- **\"כמה נשאר בסוף תלוי קרן\":** right away it says there are no funds for test. Lower down on the left, \"כל הקרנות על test\" says \"אין עדיין קרנות ברשימה\". There's also a \"לחיפוש במאיה\" link I didn't open.\n- **\"כל החשבונות\":** I read the first line, \"מסודרים לפי מה שכל חשבון גובה\". Then I just went by the numbers: פסגות 1,058 ₪, אינטראקטיב ישראל 1,303, Interactive Brokers 2,759, לאומי 4,547, and it climbs all the way to אקסלנס at 26,861. That's huge next to 1,058.\n- **Coloured bars:** the colour key is at the bottom: עמלות קנייה ומכירה, דמי משמרת, דמי ניהול חשבון, המרת מטבע. I glanced at it once. I didn't know what דמי משמרת is, so I skipped it. My guess is the red, the account fee, is what makes the bottom ones so expensive.\n- **Skipped:** the grey \"לא בחישוב\" lines under each row, the long paragraph under the \"כל החשבונות\" heading, and the box \"מה כתוב בפרסום, מול התעריפון\". I only saw in that box that פסגות has \"3 טענות\", and that bugged me a little. I also skipped the small text at the bottom and the inflation/dollar line.\n\n**Where I got stuck:** the page is literally built for \"test\", and then it tells me it has nothing on test. I'm also not sure if 1,058 ₪ is per year or for all 10 years. I'm not sure the cheap account even matters when there's no fund. I'd probably close it there and ask someone at work which fund to buy.\n\n**Didn't get:** דמי משמרת, מחיר להוראה קבוע, קרן מחקה vs בחו\"ל, מאיה, טענות."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5566,"cache_read_input_tokens":9919,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5566},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f3bd71c-ae63-4c29-b90e-638fc3aa099b","uuid":"10caed7b-4307-4806-837c-a8db4c63d8b3","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:44:22.043Z","request_id":"req_011CgmhGoWZ1sD3o5AiaRQHC"}
